          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ધીરવું (dhīrvũ) is a tadbhava. CDIAL lists it, glossed \"to trust, lend\", under Sanskrit dhī́ra, \"wise; steady, resolute\" (CDIAL 6817)."
