          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The origin of વ્યાજ (vyāj) is not settled. It matches Sanskrit vyāja, \"pretext\", in form, but CDIAL has no entry for vyāja and no Gujarati word for interest, so the link is unconfirmed."
